WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.228 --> 00:00:02.207
-Paris, thanks so much
for being here. I appreciate it.

00:00:02.207 --> 00:00:03.738
I know the heat wave's
been crazy.

00:00:03.738 --> 00:00:05.437
It was like 97 degrees
the other day.

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:07.000
-That's hot.
-Did you see that

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.508
Ross and Rachel
might be dating in real life?

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.876
-That's hot.
-How would you pronounce

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.277
Kevin Hart's
last name in a British accent?

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.545
-[ British accent ] That's hot.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.980
-Hey, what's this?
-Don't touch that.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.981
-Why?
-Because it could burn you.

00:00:15.981 --> 00:00:17.984
-Kitchen safety.
Now, that's hot.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:21.588
♪♪

